==== examples/README.md
The sixteen ordered jobs exercise alias normalization, ignored endpoint assertions,
authorized preferred identities, peer authority, privacy across hops, failed-source
propagation, duplicate compact From, unknown claims and quoted display-names.
The expected wire strings are part of the public contract examples.
